<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair cuts some business-class fares.</title>
<headline>Swissair cuts some business-class fares.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair-Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG said it was cutting some business-class fares in Europe by an average 10 percent, effective tomorrow.</p>
<p>&quot;As of tomorrow, Swissair is introducing new business-class fares for many European destinations that are on average 10 percent below full-fare tariffs,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;This latest move aims to boost competitiveness and thus to win back market share,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>Previous fare-cutting exercises have been limited to economy-class fares.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
